{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1549784-stat-yourself","id":1549784,"title":"Stat Yourself.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-04-03T17:37:37-07:00","id":1549784,"title":"Stat Yourself.","content":"All I know for sure, is that, I have a Dodge of 3 since I'm always the last one out in dodge-ball. I also have a clean driving-record, no tickets or accidents. Dodge is useful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-03T17:49:43-07:00","id":1549785,"title":"","content":"I think that I have luck Stat of 4 or maybe 5 as I always seem have good things happening to me. Nothing earth shattering like winning a lottery but I usually find books, movies or games that I'm looking for. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-03T18:22:37-07:00","id":1549790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1549784-stat-yourself?p=1549785#post1549785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that I have luck Stat of 4 or maybe 5 as I always seem have good things happening to me. Nothing earth shattering like winning a lottery but I usually find books, movies or games that I'm looking for. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe the Luck merit? People have said that about me too, as I can always magically find a cool place to live or I get hired on the spot for interviews and, &quot;You go through jobs like prostitutes go through johns&quot;(someone actually said that about me), but, as often I have good luck, I also don't find a cool place to live or get hired on the spot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-03T18:44:45-07:00","id":1549796,"title":"","content":"Strength 2 ~ Dex 2 ~ Stamina 2<br /> Charisma 2 ~ Manipulation 2 ~ Appearance 2 or 3<br /> Perception 2 ~ Intelligence 3 ~ Wits 2<br /> <br /> I'd need time to go through the list for Abilities, but in short: a lot of 1's and 2's.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-03T22:25:19-07:00","id":1549805,"title":"","content":"Maybe I would give myself 3 dots in wits as I'm able to keep a level head when situations change dramatically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-04T08:56:32-07:00","id":1549814,"title":"","content":"In the old V:tM they tied Strength to bench press.<br /> <br /> <img width=\"493\" height=\"420\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://scontent-iad3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/347590399_10161116371841060_4149088770682369220_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=-63FTicVfoYQ7kNvwEoAuPV&amp;_nc_oc=AdltPtu8rYxXZBuyiVxBn623V6XPUxL3_Xg-J14A1diTyAbRcAO2j9Xrl_mOQhTqbz4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.xx&amp;_nc_gid=n9j-dQTzLxTTUXdfqgx-xw&amp;oh=00_AYFI_v2sBXEyIR_pWrrzNg1rXcPJUq_Mz6TscLtM7WcyDw&amp;oe=67F5CFBB\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://scontent-iad3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/347590399_10161116371841060_4149088770682369220_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=-63FTicVfoYQ7kNvwEoAuPV&amp;_nc_oc=AdltPtu8rYxXZBuyiVxBn623V6XPUxL3_Xg-J14A1diTyAbRcAO2j9Xrl_mOQhTqbz4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.xx&amp;_nc_gid=n9j-dQTzLxTTUXdfqgx-xw&amp;oh=00_AYFI_v2sBXEyIR_pWrrzNg1rXcPJUq_Mz6TscLtM7WcyDw&amp;oe=67F5CFBB\" data-thumb-url=\"https://scontent-iad3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/347590399_10161116371841060_4149088770682369220_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_ohc=-63FTicVfoYQ7kNvwEoAuPV&amp;_nc_oc=AdltPtu8rYxXZBuyiVxBn623V6XPUxL3_Xg-J14A1diTyAbRcAO2j9Xrl_mOQhTqbz4&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.xx&amp;_nc_gid=n9j-dQTzLxTTUXdfqgx-xw&amp;oh=00_AYFI_v2sBXEyIR_pWrrzNg1rXcPJUq_Mz6TscLtM7WcyDw&amp;oe=67F5CFBB\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> I can bench press 400 lb, when I first did it, I was like &quot;Yay, I have a Strength of 4 in V:tM&quot; Putting me in the tiny category of people who have a Str 4 in WoD and who actually care about it.<br /> <br /> <br /> So if I had to say my attributes, they may be the following:<br /> <br /> Strength 4<br /> Dexterity 2<br /> Stamina 3<br /> <br /> Charisma 2<br /> Manipulation 2<br /> Appearance 2<br /> <br /> Intelligence 4<br /> Wits 2<br /> Perception 2<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-06T19:33:02-07:00","id":1549891,"title":"","content":"As for other stats.<br /> <br /> Physical Strength:2<br /> Physical Dexterity:3<br /> Physical Stamina:3<br /> <br /> Social Charisma:3<br /> Social Manipulation:2<br /> Social Composure:3<br /> <br /> Mental Intelligence: 2<br /> Mental Wits:3<br /> Mental Resolve: 4<br /> <br /> This is probably as close to accurate if I was myself in the game.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-14T16:16:29-07:00","id":1550122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1549784-stat-yourself?p=1549814#post1549814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the old V:tM they tied Strength to bench press.<br /> <br /> <br /> I can bench press 400 lb, when I first did it, I was like &quot;Yay, I have a Strength of 4 in V:tM&quot; Putting me in the tiny category of people who have a Str 4 in WoD and who actually care about it.<br /> <br /> <br /> . . .<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>On a shoulder squat-machine, in college, the one that the football players used, I squatted 600lbs, using my legs/whole-body once or twice. I can, in reality, only bench 180lbs, but I could easily lift a double-fridge or armoire, up a flight of stairs with little help on a refer-dolly. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}